富。\n4、能力要求：\n①具备较强的品牌思维，对品牌调性、传播节奏有精准把控力；\n②沟通表达能力出色，能高效对接内外部资源，协调推进工作；\n③执行力强，抗压能力佳，能适应多任务并行及阶段性加班；\n④创新意识突出，善于捕捉热点话题，能结合品牌特点策划有创意的宣传内容与活动；\n⑤数据敏感度高，能通过数据分析优化宣传方案，具备良好的复盘总结能力。\n5、其他：\n①提供过往主导的品牌宣传案例（如文案作品、活动方案、宣传报告等）者优先；\n②可接受偶尔出差（如参加行业展会、落地线下活动）。","ClassificationOne":"职能类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-04T08:41:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"4355eee6-2eb8-4414-ae70-8a8e6259fe70","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151151148,"PostDateInt":1772528352000,"PostDate":"2026-03-03T16:59:12","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工艺开发高级工程师/经理(J12436)","OrgId":2626756,"Org":"制造研发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、作为部门重要项目技术负责人，统筹工艺开发，并承担工艺开发团队的管理及协调工作；\n2、新制造技术